                                    "_type": "rl-rich-text",
                                    "_id": "836790b1c96b",
                                    "content": "<h2>How do I get an order of protection in Shelby County?</h2><p>[NEEDS ATTORNEY INPUT &mdash; the practical filing steps in Shelby County. Write this as plainly as possible: name the courthouse, say what to bring, and say what happens on the same day. Someone reading this may be deciding whether to leave the house.]</p><h2>How long does an order of protection last in Tennessee?</h2><p>[NEEDS ATTORNEY INPUT &mdash; ex parte duration and the hearing that follows. Legal substance.]</p><h2>What if a petition has been filed against me?</h2><p>[NEEDS ATTORNEY INPUT &mdash; the firm also defends against petitions, per the approved copy. Say so plainly; respondents search for this and find almost nothing written for them.]</p>",
                                    "measure": "default"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
